{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:07.76]Honorable Court\n[Chorus]\n[00:16.32]Missed the days I woke up, you were next to me (Yeah)\n[00:20.14]Get a quick reply when you be textin' me (Yeah)\n[00:23.56]And you always keep it real, don't gotta flex to me (Yeah)\n[00:27.32]So no matter where I go, I'll always need you by my side\n[00:31.66]Yeah, you're down to ride, Bonnie and Clyde\n[00:35.58]If a nigga try to take you, straight homicide\n[00:39.32]That's on my life, just be my wife\n[00:43.18]Let me come and sweep you right up off your feet (Ayy)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:47.06]I'm so used to sadness, that shit follows me (Ayy)\n[00:50.86]Happiness you bring, baby, be my queen\n[00:54.72]Yeah, I know these demons comin' after me (Ayy)\n[00:58.60]With you in my arms, I ain't worried 'bout a thing\n[01:02.84]Can't get enough of your kisses, baby, I miss it\n[01:05.76]When I'm around you, I fit in, usually feel like a misfit\n[01:10.20]I know we just met, but baby, this is different\n[01:13.42]You're so self-sufficient, choke you like submissive (Ayy)\n[01:17.74]Baby, if I said it, then I fuckin' meant it (Ayy)\n[01:21.22]I will never treat you bad like these other niggas (Ayy)\n[01:25.54]I know these prescriptions got a nigga trippin' (Ayy)\n[01:28.76]But on the real, I'm tryna overdose on you\n[Chorus]\n[01:33.12]Missed the days I woke up, you were next to me (Yeah)\n[01:36.94]Get a quick reply when you be textin' me (Yeah)\n[01:40.36]And you always keep it real, don't gotta flex to me (Yeah)\n[01:44.12]So no matter where I go, I'll always need you by my side\n[01:48.46]Yeah, you're down to ride, Bonnie and Clyde\n[01:52.38]If a nigga try to take you, straight homicide\n[01:56.12]That's on my life, just be my wife\n[01:59.94]Let me show you somethin' you ain't ever seen (Ayy)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:03.80]Got me cuffed up like a felony (Ayy)\n[02:07.62]Hit it from the back, that shit heavenly (Ayy)\n[02:11.46]Now we in the groove like the '70s (Ayy)\n[02:14.84]Won't take no call, still pickin' up your phone calls\n[02:18.76]Baby, I'm a beast\n[02:20.66]Girl, you got me in a world that's drama-free, ayy\n[02:25.04]All these other hoes, they be wanna-be's\n[02:27.76]I don't wanna be with nobody except you, you, you\n[Chorus]\n[02:34.56]Missed the days I woke up, you were next to me (Yeah)\n[02:38.38]Get a quick reply when you be textin' me (Yeah)\n[02:41.80]And you always keep it real, don't gotta flex to me (Yeah)\n[02:45.56]So no matter where I go, I'll always need you by my side\n[02:49.90]Yeah, you're down to ride, Bonnie and Clyde\n[02:53.82]If a nigga try to take you, straight homicide\n[02:57.56]That's on my life, just be my wife\n[03:01.46]I'll give you the world to have you next to me, ayy","words":[[7.76,8.64,"Honorable"],[8.76,9.2,"Court"],[16.32,16.66,"Missed"],[16.7,16.74,"the"],[16.78,17.02,"days"],[17.18,17.18,"I"],[17.24,17.5,"woke"],[17.58,17.66,"up,"],[17.76,17.82,"you"],[17.92,18.1,"were"],[18.2,18.48,"next"],[18.52,18.58,"to"],[18.68,18.78,"me"],[19.18,19.38,"(Yeah)"],[20.14,20.32,"Get"],[20.42,20.42,"a"],[20.54,20.76,"quick"],[20.86,21.28,"reply"],[21.38,21.5,"when"],[21.58,21.66,"you"],[21.78,21.86,"be"],[21.98,22.48,"textin'"],[22.52,22.58,"me"],[22.98,23.16,"(Yeah)"],[23.56,23.66,"And"],[23.74,23.82,"you"],[24.06,24.36,"always"],[24.42,24.66,"keep"],[24.78,24.82,"it"],[24.94,25.12,"real,"],[25.2,25.36,"don't"],[25.42,25.7,"gotta"],[25.8,26.08,"flex"],[26.18,26.26,"to"],[26.34,26.42,"me"],[26.8,26.92,"(Yeah)"],[27.32,27.38,"So"],[27.56,27.62,"no"],[27.8,28.12,"matter"],[28.28,28.4,"where"],[28.64,28.64,"I"],[28.76,28.82,"go,"],[29.06,29.24,"I'll"],[29.34,29.62,"always"],[29.74,29.96,"need"],[30.0,30.06,"you"],[30.18,30.24,"by"],[30.4,30.52,"my"],[30.64,31.24,"side"],[31.66,31.8,"Yeah,"],[31.9,32.08,"you're"],[32.12,32.34,"down"],[32.4,32.44,"to"],[32.6,33.08,"ride,"],[33.6,33.96,"Bonnie"],[34.04,34.16,"and"],[34.46,35.16,"Clyde"],[35.58,35.7,"If"],[35.78,35.78,"a"],[35.94,36.22,"nigga"],[36.42,36.62,"try"],[36.68,36.76,"to"],[36.9,37.1